From: Arian <arian@kulmer.hu>
Subject: Handle the Android 17 CaptureResultExtras constructor

toTotalCaptureResult() reflects on the hidden CaptureResultExtras
constructor to translate the MIUI custom result. Android 17 added
lastCompletedRegularFrameNumber, lastCompletedReprocessFrameNumber,
lastCompletedZslFrameNumber, hasReadoutTimestamp and
readoutTimestamp (13 params), so both the 11-param and the 8-param
lookups failed and the VirtualCameraReprocessor stalled, leaving the
shot pending forever.

Extend the first lookup to the 13-param constructor and fill the new
fields with their neutral values (0 / false).

---
diff --git a/smali_classes3/com/xiaomi/protocol/ICustomCaptureResult.smali b/smali_classes3/com/xiaomi/protocol/ICustomCaptureResult.smali
index 6406b1ed..54faec57 100644
--- a/smali_classes3/com/xiaomi/protocol/ICustomCaptureResult.smali
+++ b/smali_classes3/com/xiaomi/protocol/ICustomCaptureResult.smali
@@ -509,7 +509,7 @@
 
     if-lt v1, v8, :cond_0
 
-    const/16 v1, 0xb
+    const/16 v1, 0xd
 
     :try_start_1
     new-array v8, v1, [Ljava/lang/Class;
@@ -546,6 +546,12 @@
     const/16 v21, 0xa
 
     aput-object v20, v8, v21
+    sget-object v18, Ljava/lang/Boolean;->TYPE:Ljava/lang/Class;
+    const/16 v19, 0xb
+    aput-object v18, v8, v19
+    sget-object v18, Ljava/lang/Long;->TYPE:Ljava/lang/Class;
+    const/16 v19, 0xc
+    aput-object v18, v8, v19
 
     .line 7
     invoke-virtual {v7, v8}, Ljava/lang/Class;->getDeclaredConstructor([Ljava/lang/Class;)Ljava/lang/reflect/Constructor;
@@ -623,6 +629,14 @@
     move-result-object v19
 
